      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-24T15:37:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "yes apple means all apple silicon, so iphones and m* chips. Mac means mac devices without apple silicon. Apple uses the same language for their feature tables for metal, https://developer.apple.com/metal/Metal-Feature-Set-Tables.pdf",
      "parentUuid": "f129c075_7382dafb",
      "range": {
