      "writtenOn": "2022-08-24T15:43:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I haven\u0027t looked closely at this doc before, sorry, and it\u0027s pretty enormous. What specifically should I look for here? The first chart I see shows \"Mac\" as a mix of Intel GPU, AMD GPU, and M1/M2 GPU (which matches the colloquial term): http://screen/3zQMtBxRhCJo59Q",
