      "writtenOn": "2022-08-24T18:09:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re eGPUs: in practice AFAIK none exist for M1 Macs yet (no drivers). But let\u0027s go with Jim\u0027s suggestion and drop the compile time check.",
      "parentUuid": "32b2f9c5_967c25f4",
